  "description": "This is a Shell shape armchair, made of Plywood. The seating area is created, with 4 denim covered cushions. For the head rest, i used a leather cushion. Great asset, for contemporary style interiors. There are no screws or nails used in the assembly process.\n\nIf you want to learn, how to create a 3D model in Blender, please visit my YouTube Channel. \nI have a beginner course!\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lGliwP2lpSw&t=196s",
